    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(18th Level)</em></p><p>You force metaphor into literal reality.</p><p>Once per arc:</p><p>Declare a metaphor.</p><p>For the scene, it becomes physically true.</p><p>Examples:</p><ul><li><p>“He is a storm.” → Environmental upheaval follows him.</p></li><li><p>“This place is a cage.” → Exits resist escape.</p></li><li><p>“They are wolves.” → Pack coordination manifests.</p></li><li><p>“This city is a wound.” → Bleeding consequences escalate.</p></li></ul><h3>Cost</h3><p>the top of the misfire ladder.</p><p>a misfire at the top of the ladder is guaranteed.</p><p>Reality will respond after the scene.</p><p>You cannot Make It True quietly.</p><p>The universe remembers.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
